{"segments": [{"index": 3, "text": "现有证据只说明聚类信息对 subtraction 方法“高度推荐”，并未把聚类列为 autoEstCont 的必需输入或执行阻断条件。", "basis": "KG_GROUNDED", "citations": [{"index": 5, "quote": "As expression data is highly sparse at the single cell level, it is highly recommended that clustering
information be provided to allow the subtraction method to share information between cells."}], "context_fact_ids": []}, {"index": 4, "text": "提醒：autoEstCont 的科学假设是通道内包含多种具有不同标记基因的细胞类型；对高度同质的细胞可能得到警告、错误或极高污染估计，这属于可检测性局限，不代表当前数据一定不适用。", "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT", "citations": [{"index": 6, "quote": "It is also possible to manually specify the contamination fraction, which can be useful when the aforementioned estimation procedures are deemed inaccurate or it is desirable to overcorrect the data. For most applications, the consequences of manually setting an unrealistically high contamination rate are likely to be minimal. Contamination is preferentially removed from genes closest to the background expression (i.e., genes with low levels of expression), meaning that setting a higher global contamination rate is unlikely to completely remove the expression of genes that are truly markers of a cell. Thus in some applications it may be preferable to overcorrect for background contamination and remove a small amount of genuine signal to ensure that all the background contamination has been removed. We also find that our method is robust to small inaccuracies in the estimation of the global contamination rate (Supplementary Fig. S4)."}], "context_fact_ids": []}, {"index": 5, "text": "提醒：背景表达谱通常由低 UMI 的空液滴估计，但现有来源没有给出可推广到任意数据的全局整数阈值或必需顺序，不能据此要求必须先过滤空液滴。", "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT", "citations": [{"index": 7, "quote": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells."}], "context_fact_ids": []}], "governance": {"statements": [{"statement_id": "statement-revision:307509c44324bb73bc3d016c:1", "statement": "Clustering information is recommended for subtraction; it is not a required input or an execution block.", "registered_statement": {"assertion_kind": "recommendation", "epistemic_status": "asserted", "object_id": "requirement:c898d4868fd4c24edf33", "ontology_version": "2.0.0-core-review.1", "polarity": "POSITIVE", "predicate": "has_requirement", "qualifiers": {"parameter_condition": {"datatype": "string", "operator": "equals", "parameter_id": "parameter:r:soupx:adjustCounts:method", "values": ["subtraction"]}, "software_version": {"expression": "1.6.2", "status": "exact", "subject_id": "package-release:r:soupx:1.6.2"}}, "record_type": "StatementRevision", "schema_version": "sckg-ontology-core-5c-design-v1", "scope_status": "explicit", "statement_id": "statement:307509c44324bb73bc3d016c", "statement_revision_id": "statement-revision:307509c44324bb73bc3d016c:1", "subject_id": "operator-revision:r:soupx:adjustCounts:1.6.2"}, "predicate": "has_requirement", "scope": {"status": "unknown", "dimensions": {"parameter_condition": "unknown", "software_version": "unknown"}, "scope_status": "explicit", "qualifiers": {"parameter_condition": {"datatype": "string", "operator": "equals", "parameter_id": "parameter:r:soupx:adjustCounts:method", "values": ["subtraction"]}, "software_version": {"expression": "1.6.2", "status": "exact", "subject_id": "package-release:r:soupx:1.6.2"}}, "approval_implies_applicability": false}, "requirements": [{"activation_status": "specified", "combination": "ALL_OF", "id": "requirement:c898d4868fd4c24edf33", "ontology_version": "2.0.0-core-review.1", "record_type": "Requirement", "schema_version": "sckg-ontology-core-5c-design-v1", "strength": "RECOMMENDED", "when": [{"datatype": "string", "operator": "equals", "parameter_id": "parameter:r:soupx:adjustCounts:method", "values": ["subtraction"]}]}], "constraints": [{"id": "constraint:9354292eaf2ae052612d", "ontology_version": "2.0.0-core-review.1", "record_type": "RepresentationConstraint", "schema_version": "sckg-ontology-core-5c-design-v1"}], "knowledge_status": "approved", "snapshot_id": "approved-scientific-kg-v2-01", "trusted": true, "production_retrieval_eligible": true, "recommendation_eligible": false, "execution_gate": false, "execution_authorized": false, "assessment_ids"