\begin{equation*} b_{g} = \frac{\sum _d n_{g,d}}{\sum _d \sum _g n_{g,d}}, \end{equation*}\end{document}where ng, d is the number of counts for gene g in droplet d and the sum over d is taken over all droplets with <Nemp UMIs (Fig. 1). The species-mixing experiment allows us to compare how accurately bg recapitulates the true background expression found within each cell, revealing that any value of Nemp < 100 produces a good correlation, with the best correlation given when Nemp < 10 (Supplementary Fig. S2).", "locator": {"kind": "section", "value": "source-artifact:c077c1f8c4f5ca49b8a82f25e0fae735/xml:/article/body/sec[2]/p[4];text-sha256:777cf343f0167f7547104c764e4a8c31f33e77873c2b44c21032cb08ff973fef:3764:4722"}, "ontology_version": "2.0.0-core-review.1", "schema_version": "sckg-ontology-core-5c-design-v1", "section": "xml:/article/body/sec[2]/p[4]", "source_artifact_id": "source-artifact:c077c1f8c4f5ca49b8a82f25e0fae735", "source_revision_id": "source-revision:9c88c5d94c9742da426d218b", "start_offset": 3764}], "execution_authorized": false, "human_review_status": "pending", "routing_basis": "Source co-occurrence or explicit gap subject; not an ontology relation or applicability assertion.", "scope_status": "unknown", "source_excerpt_available": true, "status": "unasserted_candidate_caution", "subject_ids": ["method:soupx", "method:soupx-marker-contamination-estimation"], "supports_negative_claim": false, "supports_positive_claim": false, "scientific_assertion": false, "trusted": false, "production_retrieval_eligible": false, "execution_gate": false}], "reference_links": {"5": {"statement_ids": ["statement-revision:307509c44324bb73bc3d016c:1"], "caution_ids": []}, "6": {"statement_ids": [], "caution_ids": ["evidence-gap:cab33c88e969fce65b4fb8a4"]}, "7": {"statement_ids": [], "caution_ids": ["evidence-gap:4c3364dadc943e4e9129c52d"]}}}}
